                                                                rdfs:comment "IVDR risk class C: high risk IVD devices, such as HIV and cancer diagnostic tests."@en ;
                                                                rdfs:label "Class C"@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/ClassD
