                                                                rdfs:comment "IVDR risk class D: highest risk IVD devices, such as blood screening tests for infectious diseases."@en ;
                                                                rdfs:label "Class D"@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/ClassI
<http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/ClassI> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                         <http://www.semanticweb.org/vicky/ontologies/2026/3/ODM/MDRRiskClass> ;
                                                                rdfs:comment "MDR risk class I: lowest risk, generally non-invasive devices."@en ;
